      "created_at": "2026-09-20T10:26:16Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-20T10:26:16Z",
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "cACK: All other apps MUST use the HMAC output.\n\nThis is worth adding to the BIP. I agree with akarve an application intended to support every HWW should try to use <= 512-bits to avoid the DRNG.\n\nHowever for the BIP93 app we run into a conflict where BIP93 can't be implemented with only 512-bits so its unfortunately a DRNG app. Future codex32 profiles like extended private keys or passwords would need even more bits (for shares).",
